To look at the cryptographic signing certificate using apksigner, you need to install it on your Ubuntu system first.
## 1. Install apksigner
Run this command to install the package:

sudo apt update && sudo apt install -y apksigner

## 2. Verify the APK Fingerprint
Once the installation finishes, run the verification command again to print out the certificate hashes:

apksigner verify --print-certs "Bitget Wallet.apk"

